{"id":"611242","name":"蔬菜奶香鸡蛋饼","author":"优子家的味道","authorId":"9910251","desc":"","cover":"images/611242/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"生菜","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"黑芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"生菜洗净切碎。","img":"images/611242/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入一勺面粉。","img":"images/611242/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"依次放入盐、味精、十三香。","img":"images/611242/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"打入三个鸡蛋。","img":"images/611242/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入适量牛奶。","img":"images/611242/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/611242/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"电饼铛预热刷油。","img":"images/611242/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入一勺面糊并迅速摊匀。","img":"images/611242/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撒上黑芝麻。","img":"images/611242/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖盖煎一分钟。","img":"images/611242/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"一分钟后翻面再煎一分钟即可出锅。","img":"images/611242/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅后可切成小块，方便食用。","img":"images/611242/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"美味漂亮，营养丰富，老少皆宜，简单易上手，保你一次成功！","img":"images/611242/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"生菜易熟，切记盖盖煎时间不可过长。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}